### Ban
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/admin/users/<user-id>/ban
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>

### Unban
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/admin/users/<user-id>/unban
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>

### Audit logs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/admin/audit-logs?targetType=USER
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>
